### Chatbot Service API Testing

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5294

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Chatbot/health

### 2. Get Available Time Slots (Next 7 Days)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Chatbot/available-slots

### 3. Get Available Time Slots for Specific Date
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Chatbot/available-slots?startDate=2025-11-10&days=5

### 4. Chat - Ask about available time slots
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Chatbot/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "What are the available time slots for next week?"
}

### 5. Chat - Ask about specific date
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Chatbot/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Show me available appointments for tomorrow",
  "preferredDate": "2025-11-09"
}

### 6. Chat - General question
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Chatbot/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "What services do you provide?"
}

### 7. Chat - When can I book
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Chatbot/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "When can I schedule my car for service?"
}

### 8. Chat - Available slots this week
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Chatbot/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Are there any free slots this week?"
}
